WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
Hey Wesley, hey Jason! Here's a quick walkthrough of the Stellar Glass workspace.

00:09.000 --> 00:18.000
Right at the top of the screen, you've got one-click shortcut buttons to jump straight to CAD Takeoff, Proposals, Billing, or Melina S. Arias's Accounting Hub, plus Command-K search from anywhere.

00:18.000 --> 00:26.500
And whenever a customer requests a quote on your public website, it lands right here in Website Requests so you can turn it into a job and schedule the measure in one click.

00:26.500 --> 00:35.500
Inside any job, open the Files tab to drop in architectural PDFs, site photos, or AutoCAD DXF and DWG drawings.

00:35.500 --> 00:44.000
Everything backs up automatically to your Google Drive folder.

00:44.000 --> 00:52.000
Click Open in CAD and 3D Takeoff on any drawing, and Stellar Glass loads the vector geometry at true one-to-one scale and counts every window and storefront tag on the sheet.

00:52.000 --> 01:00.500
To clean up a busy architectural floor plan, just click the Glazing and Dims filter chip.

01:00.500 --> 01:08.500
That hides the structural grids, walls, and hatching so only your storefront elevations and dimensions stay on screen.

01:08.500 --> 01:16.000
Then pick the Box Width-by-Height tool, click two corners of any opening, or trace continuous runs with the Perimeter tool to log your footage.

01:16.000 --> 01:25.000
Next, choose your framing system, like Trulite CG451 four-and-a-half-inch storefront or frameless heavy glass shower enclosures.

01:25.000 --> 01:34.000
Stellar Glass automatically deducts the perimeter caulk joints, jambs, head, sill, and intermediate mullions.

01:34.000 --> 01:43.000
You get the exact Daylight Opening, the tempered or insulated glass cut size, and the twenty-four-foot aluminum stock lengths and sealant tubes needed for the job.

01:43.000 --> 01:51.000
Want to double-check the elevation before ordering glass? Click View in 3D to orbit and zoom around the storefront frame.

01:51.000 --> 02:02.500
You can preview Clear Anodized, Dark Bronze, or Matte Black aluminum finishes with Low-E tinted glass, inspect every mullion and transom, and save a snapshot right into the job folder.

02:02.500 --> 02:11.500
When you're ready to price the job or order material, click Send to Proposal or Send to Trulite Order.

02:11.500 --> 02:24.000
On every proposal, you can choose whether Wesley Stel or Jason Vergara is sending the estimate, so the PDF signature block and outgoing email show your exact name and title.

02:24.000 --> 02:32.500
Once a customer accepts your proposal, convert it into a Contract with a single click and track any Change Orders along the way.

02:32.500 --> 02:41.000
From there, you can generate AIA G702 and G703 progress pay applications with ten percent retainage, or send a Stripe payment link on an invoice.

02:41.000 --> 02:48.500
And everything flows automatically into the Accounting and Notary Hub for Melina S. Arias to notarize and sync with QuickBooks.
